    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "L(w,c)=\\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_{i=1}^n (y_i-\\hat y_i)^2.\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Derive the gradients:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}=\\;\\ldots,\n",
